# In points from the lower left corner.  The drawing is centered in the
# room; the title block stands in the lower right corner, under it.
paper 792 612
room 36 104 756 576
# The room the drawing keeps, in points at scale 1: a wire from a body
# of another net and a body from a body; text from anything else; a
# body from its own label; round a flag, for the labels.
clear body 3.6
clear text 1.5
clear label 2.5
clear flag 2
line 18 18 774 18 774 594 18 594 18 18
line 486 18 486 90
line 486 90 774 90
line 486 48 774 48
line 588 18 588 48
line 630 18 630 48
line 666 18 666 48
line 720 18 720 48
line 738 48 738 90
text 3.24 0 0 490 83 TITLE
text 7.128 0 0 498 64 $Title
text 3.24 0 0 742 83 SIZE
text 7.128 0 1 756 62 A
text 3.24 0 0 490 41 FILE
text 4.536 0 0 490 30 $File
text 3.24 0 0 592 41 PAGE
text 4.536 0 1 609 30 $Page
text 3.24 0 0 634 41 REV
text 4.536 0 1 648 30 $Rev
text 3.24 0 0 670 41 DATE
text 4.536 0 1 693 30 $Date
text 3.24 0 0 724 41 DRAWN
text 4.536 0 1 747 30 $Drawn
